+    Steward SQL is registered by a human, but a Space can be narrowed after it
+    was. The verified lane is stubbed to return what a submit of that SQL
+    would have produced.
+    """
+    exe = Executor(cortex=FakeCortex(submits=[], asks=[]), minter=minter)  # type: ignore[arg-type]
